    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzzzl3lbbs2i",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "In a little over a week we will see the release of The Last Human Game.\n\nThere will never be another AAA game at the scale of GTA 6 with no AI assistance. People in the future will look back at an all-human game with an billion dollar budget and wonder how they did it, like the Pyramids.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mzzzl3lbbs2i",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-11T13:07:54.824Z",
      "likes": 157,
      "replies": 14,
      "reposts": 10,
      "score": 7.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.3,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 9.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n22xdtz4kk2i",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "People who have no contact with coders seem to have no idea how much an entire profession transformed in less than a year due to AI. It is so weird to still see comments here that AI hasn’t changed anything or that AI code is bad or that companies are retreating from AI use. Does not match reality.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n22xdtz4kk2i",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-11T22:00:44.261Z",
      "likes": 89,
      "replies": 8,
      "reposts": 16,
      "score": 7.2,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.1,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 0.7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzyzlpr6lk2r",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "I asked Fable 5.2 & Gemini Carbon to \"Solve the Fermi Paradox. Marshal data, test hypotheses, pressure test them against critics, give me likely answers if you cant get a definite conclusion\"\n\nThey did not solve it, but did do interesting stuff.\n\nFable 5.2: where-is-everybody-fermi.netlify.app",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mzyzlpr6lk2r",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-11T03:35:36.254Z",
      "likes": 47,
      "replies": 10,
      "reposts": 3,
      "score": 6.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 19.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzltzpjm3k2c",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "I’m still kind of baffled by how surprised or even disbelieving some university admin are when I tell them that many (most? need more data) students are not all in on AI, actually…",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3mzltzpjm3k2c",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-05T21:51:26.703Z",
      "likes": 273,
